# DavidAI needs no API key, provider account, or .env.local for normal use.
# Chat, retrieval, embeddings and image generation use local files and binaries.
#
# There are no NEXT_PUBLIC_ secrets to configure. Never put a secret in a
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* variable because Next.js exposes those values to the browser.
#
# Optional deployment override. Vercel's function filesystem is read-only
# except temp storage, so DavidAI uses a temp data directory automatically.
# Set this only if you mount persistent writable storage.
# DAVIDAI_DATA_DIR=/tmp/davidai-data
#
# The variables below are INACTIVE legacy settings for src/app/api/chat/.
# That provider route is unwired and is not called by the application at
# runtime. Leave them commented; they are not required and do nothing today.

# DAVIDAI_LLM_PROVIDER=openai-compatible
# DAVIDAI_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# DAVIDAI_LLM_API_KEY=sk-...
# DAVIDAI_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
